        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Google Chrome deprecated (Browsing) Topics API.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Google Chrome deprecated (Browsing) Topics API, so mark the following MDN features deprecated:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>document.browsingTopics()</li>
<li>browsingtopics attribute on HTML &lt;iframe&gt;</li>
<li>browsingTopics option in fetch()</li>
<li>Sec-Browsing-Topics HTTP request header</li>
<li>Observe-Browsing-Topics HTTP response header</li>
<li>HTTP header Permissions-Policy directive browsing-topics</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Source:<br>
<a href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/_R85yctz4Rs" rel="nofollow">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/_R85yctz4Rs</a></p>


